# 第 40 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：2c608aff, 84ba50d3, 49d1d64f, d19f7514, f45f5ca7, 60b61512, e98196ab, 50846271, 332f06d7, 753ea09b, cf133acc, 780d0b14, 025d127b, 20981f0e, 195c6913, b230c067, e6de6e8f, eb281b96, 31d5ba1a, 1a244afd
>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：连线/draw_line, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 重力下落/gravity_drop, 描边/outline, 拉伸/extrude, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 重涂色/recolor, 滑动/slide, 擦除/erase, 补全/completion, 填充/flood_fill, 排序/sorting, 压缩/compress, 镜像/mirror, 堆叠/stacking, 异或合成/xor_compositing, 旋转/rotate, 计数/counting, 解码/decode, 描迹/trace, 平移对齐/translate_align, 路径模拟/path_simulation, 交替转向/alternating_turn, 路径搜索/pathfinding
> - 对象类：矩形/rectangle, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 精灵/sprite, 分隔行/divider_row, 画布边界/canvas_boundary, 边缘行列/edge_row_column, 面板/panel, 边缘像素/edge_pixel, 连通分量/connected_component, 十字图案/cross_pattern, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 基底像素/substrate_pixel, 实心方块/solid_square, 蜿蜒通道/winding_channel, 目标标记/destination_marker, 轮廓线/contour_line, 封闭背景区域/enclosed_bg_region, 条缺口/bar_gap, 标记/marker, 分隔线/divider_line, 色块区域/colored_region, 前景对象/fg_object, 轮廓边界/contour_bound, 标记点阵/marker_lattice, 精灵图/sprite, 格元/lattice_cell, 粒子/particle, 起始标记/start_marker, 终止标记/end_marker, 字形/glyph, 波形图案/wave_pattern, 半区掩码/half_mask, 前景掩码/foreground_mask, 枢轴像素/pivot_pixel, 源像素/source_pixel
> - 关系类：行列对齐/row_col_align, 穿透与停靠/pass_through_or_stop, 逐像素对齐/cell_align, 颜色编码列/color_coded_col, 包围盒内部/inside_bbox, 分隔对齐/separator_alignment, 尺寸约束通行/size_constrains_passage, 轮廓围合/contour_enclosure, 列对齐/col_align, 网格分区/grid_partition, 支撑/support, 格元内居中/centered_within_cell, 颜色循环/color_cycle, 形状匹配/shape_matching, 顺序排列/sequential_order, 交替翻转/alternating_flip, 对齐/alignment, 同行或同列/same_row_or_col
> - 条件类：对齐像素投射矩形/aligned_pixel_to_rect, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 宽度决定行为/width_determines_behavior, 边缘延伸角落留黑/edge_extrude_corner_black, 并集取前景/union_foreground, 颜色决定目标列/color_determines_col, 缺失像素异色补/missing_diff_color_fill, 前景不冲突/no_fg_collision, 标记推断十字涂底/marker_cross_recolor, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 小区域被填充/small_regions_filled, 按行序分段涂色/color_by_row_order, 每区域折叠单像素/region_to_pixel, 有后续像素则移/shift_if_pixel_beyond, 距离保持不变/distance_preserved, 恰一为前景/exactly_one_foreground, 唯一重复形分涂/unique_vs_repeated_recolor, 弯头决定偏移/elbow_determines_offset, 单行重叠拼接/one_row_overlap
