> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：裁剪/crop, 放大画布/expand_canvas, 补全/complete, 重涂色/recolor, 平铺/tiling, 对称检测/symmetry_detect, 像素放大/pixel_upscale, 膨胀/dilate, 透明叠加/overlay, 压缩/compress, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 平移/translate, 擦除/erase, 放置/place, 计数/counting, 绘点/draw_dots, 填充/fill, 延伸/extend, 缩放/scaling, 镜像/mirror
> - 对象类：前景面板/foreground_panel, 象限/quadrant, 角位边角/corner_piece, 三角轮廓/triangle_outline, 前景列/foreground_column, 背景像素/background_pixel, 前景对象/foreground_object, 控制精灵/control_sprite, 多色瓦片/polychrome_tile, 颜色图例/color_legend, 连通分量/connected_component, 封闭孔洞/enclosed_hole, 图例/legend, 数据区象限/data_quadrant, 分隔线/divider_bar, 掩码/mask, 分区网格/partitioned_grid, 稀疏前景像素/sparse_foreground_pixel, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 画布边界/canvas_boundary, 边界矩形/boundary_rectangle, 重复色对象/repeated_color_obj, 十字图案/cross_pattern, 定位像素对/locator_pixel_pair, 空心框架/hollow_frame, 图案精灵体/pattern_sprite, 角标记/corner_marker, 矩形/rectangle, 封闭行段/closed_row_segment, 精灵体/sprite, 模板/template, 指示区域/indicator_region, 瓦片/tile, 奇数边正方形/odd_side_square, 中心点/center_point, 半侧轮廓/half_outline, 对称轴/symmetry_axis
> - 空间关系类：四向反射对称/four_way_reflective_symmetry, 角位置对应/corner_correspond, 列选择/column_selection, 图例映射/legend_mapping, 掩码映射/mask_mapping, 逐像素比较/per_pixel_comparison, 奇偶交替/parity_alternation, 贴边定位/border_aligned, 中点定位/midpoint_location, 同色匹配/same_color_matching, 行列对齐/row_column_alignment, 边界包围内部/boundary_encloses_interior, 对齐匹配/alignment_match, 堆叠排列/stacked_layout, 阵列排布/array_layout, 同心定位/concentric_position, 对称/symmetry
> - 条件/判断类：角落象限提取/corner_quadrant_extraction, 补对角线边/fill_diagonal_side, 含前景列整列涂色/fg_col_full_recolor, 唯一非轴对称/unique_asymmetric, 异常值选择/outlier_selection, 像素展开为瓦片/filled_pixel_expands_to_tile, 孔洞保留不填/holes_preserved, 象限对应图例颜色/quadrant_mapped_by_legend, 共同背景标前景/both_background_marked_foreground, 分区采样/block_sampling, 交替填充至边界/alternating_fill_to_edge, 重复色才移动/repeated_color_moves, 中点居中放置/center_at_midpoint, 计数映射点数/count_maps_to_dots, 四角标记围定内部/four_corners_define_interior, 前缀图案闭合延展/prefix_pattern_closure_extension, 指示色定缩放对位/indicator_scale_align, 选无对角对称瓦片/select_asym_tile, 中间行翻转/middle_row_flipped, 边长循环变换/side_length_cycle, 内部行段填充/fill_interior_spans
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

